          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Blazing Admonition"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, evocation, fire, visual)\n\nHeat scorches those who lay eyes on the nightmarchers. All creatures in a 60-foot cone take 15d6 fire damage (34 basic Reflex save). Prone creatures and the nightmarchers' kin are unaffected as long as they have not taken a hostile action against the nightmarchers. The nightmarchers can't use Blazing Admonition for 1d4 rounds."
            },
